-- Doubled NPCs: 2026_10_27_70_world_azeroth_npcs_spawns_paths.sql added some spawns (guids 43000xxx) right next to an
-- existing spawn of the same NPC (for example two Faldrim Anvilmar). Removes the added copy where the original of that NPC
-- stands within 20 yards and the NPC has at most 4 original spawns, or the copy stands within 10 yards of an original.
-- The original spawns are kept. Safe to run twice.
